#
# Expected Criterion benchmark groups of benches/rt_gate.rs.
# Operator diagnostic manifest: documents the expected Criterion groups for
# manual operator benchmarking (`cargo bench --bench rt_gate`). Not consumed
# by an automated gate (rt_gate is outside quick and long disciplines; RT
# deadline and jitter are certified via tests/rt_metrics.rs and pipe_long_receipt).
# `PIPE_Host` drives the production RtSwapHarness real load (WaveNet A1/A2,
# LSTM, CabSim); `PIPE_AbOpt` anchors the per-topology envelopes shared with
# the ab_opt_bench ceremony.
PIPE_Host/*
PIPE_AbOpt/*
